THAT MAYBE THE AMERICAN PEOPLE

00:08:24.352 --> 00:08:26.712
SHOULD BE AWARE OF THAT THE

00:08:26.747 --> 00:08:28.071
BIDEN ADMINISTRATION ISN’T

00:08:28.072 --> 00:08:29.048
TOUCHING ON?

00:08:29.049 --> 00:08:31.975
&gt;&gt; THERE ARE MORE LEGAL RIGHTS

00:08:31.976 --> 00:08:33.856
GRANTED TO THOSE TERRORISTS

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.495
ONCE THEY’RE ON THE AMERICAN

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:36.943
MAIN LAND SOIL.

00:08:36.944 --> 00:08:39.454
NO TELLING WHAT THE LIBERAL

00:08:39.455 --> 00:08:41.340
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE AND

00:08:41.374 --> 00:08:43.898
LIBERAL JUDGES DO.

00:08:43.932 --> 00:08:46.690
THE SAFEST PLACE IS GUANTANAMO.

00:08:46.725 --> 00:08:49.192
IF IT WASN’T FOR LIBERAL JUDGES

00:08:49.226 --> 00:08:51.188
INTERVENING THEY WOULD HAVE --

00:08:51.189 --> 00:08:52.790
TERRORISM IS STILL A THREAT.

00:08:52.825 --> 00:08:54.712
IF WE HAVE OPERATIONS WHERE WE

00:08:54.713 --> 00:08:56.121
CAPTURE A LOT OF HIGH VALUE

00:08:56.155 --> 00:08:57.241
TERRORISTS IN THE FUTURE, WHERE

00:08:57.242 --> 00:08:58.233
WILL THEY PUT THEM?

00:08:58.234 --> 00:09:00.263
BRING THEM TO THE UNITED STATES

00:09:00.265 --> 00:09:02.208
OR SEND THEM TO SOME OTHER

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:05.237
COUNTRY WHERE THEY MAY NOT HAVE

00:09:05.238 --> 00:09:07.004
THE PROTECTIONS THEY DO HAVE AT

00:09:07.005 --> 00:09:07.857
GUANTANAMO?

00:09:07.858 --> 00:09:10.302
GITMO IS A SUITABLE PLACE.

00:09:10.337 --> 00:09:12.747
WE ARE DETAINING SOME OF THE

00:09:12.781 --> 00:09:13.733
WORLD’S MOST DANGEROUS

00:09:13.734 --> 00:09:14.555
TERRORISTS.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:17.227
THAT’S WHERE THEY SHOULD STAY

00:09:17.261 --> 00:09:19.049
AND FUTURE DETAINEES SHOULD GO.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.660
&gt;&gt; Harris: NOTHING RECRUITS

00:09:20.661 --> 00:09:22.287
LIKE PEOPLE INSIDE THE GREATEST

00:09:22.288 --> 00:09:24.765
COUNTRY IN THE WORLD HAVING

00:09:24.766 --> 00:09:27.580
THAT SORT OF LIBERAL ADVOCACY

00:09:27.582 --> 00:09:30.355
ON BEHALF OF THEM.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:32.314
THEY CAN TALK, THEY CAN

00:09:32.316 --> 00:09:33.001
PROSELYTIZE.

00:09:33.035 --> 00:09:36.867
&gt;&gt; I SAW THAT WAS THE CASE WITH

00:09:36.901 --> 00:09:40.055
THE BLIND SHEIK IN THE FIRST

00:09:40.089 --> 00:09:42.856
TRADE CENTER BOMBING.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:44.699
HE REMAINED AN ACTIVE

00:09:44.733 --> 00:09:46.295
PROSELYTIZEER FROM FEDERAL

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.080
PRISON IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:09:48.114 --> 00:09:49.094
&gt;&gt; Harris: SENATOR COTTON.

00:09:49.128 --> 00:09:49.661
GOOD TO SEE YOU TODAY.

